    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tales of the Withered",
    "steam_appid": 3670950,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Teetering on the Brink</strong><br>The villagers of Wither scrape by after \u201cthe Withering\u201d poisoned their fields, made them sickly and left mouths unfed. A mute, teenage stranger with a strange gift appears, her touch coaxing wounded plants to bloom in the cracked soil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow, Cook, Craft, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening &amp; Alchemy</strong><br>Cultivate hardy vegetables and rare herbs in poisoned earth. Brew healing draughts to mend the sick and smoke bombs to scare off wolf packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foraging &amp; Fishing</strong><br>Explore abandoned ruins, mines, a ship, a swamp and a volcano to scavenge herbs and mushrooms. Help the village fish, then cook nourishing stews to feed hungry villagers or sell at market for coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading &amp; Upgrading</strong><br>Trade with the merchant for precious ingredients and reagents. Earn money by selling your harvests, potions, and cooked dishes\u2014then invest in expanding your homestead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leveling &amp; Abilities</strong><br>Restore your memories, unearth lost recipes and alchemical secrets as you gain experience. Unlock new gardening techniques, cooking skills, and foraging abilities that help you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices That Shape the Valley</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Endings</strong><br>Will you champion the frail hopes of humankind\u2014fortifying the village against decay\u2014or embrace the forest\u2019s fierce will, letting its wild magic reclaim the land? Your affinity for Nature or Humanity determines both your powers and the fate of Wither.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Characters &amp; Hidden Truths</strong><br>Forge uneasy bonds with villagers like Osric, the fallen woodcutter; and sisters Ragna and Lyra, whose reckless courage may doom or save them all. Piece together the secret behind your gift\u2014and discover the true cost of the sacrifice needed to heal a world on the edge of ruin.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Teetering on the Brink</strong><br>The villagers of Wither scrape by after \u201cthe Withering\u201d poisoned their fields, made them sickly and left mouths unfed. A mute, teenage stranger with a strange gift appears, her touch coaxing wounded plants to bloom in the cracked soil.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow, Cook, Craft, Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gardening &amp; Alchemy</strong><br>Cultivate hardy vegetables and rare herbs in poisoned earth. Brew healing draughts to mend the sick and smoke bombs to scare off wolf packs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foraging &amp; Fishing</strong><br>Explore abandoned ruins, mines, a ship, a swamp and a volcano to scavenge herbs and mushrooms. Help the village fish, then cook nourishing stews to feed hungry villagers or sell at market for coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trading &amp; Upgrading</strong><br>Trade with the merchant for precious ingredients and reagents. Earn money by selling your harvests, potions, and cooked dishes\u2014then invest in expanding your homestead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leveling &amp; Abilities</strong><br>Restore your memories, unearth lost recipes and alchemical secrets as you gain experience. Unlock new gardening techniques, cooking skills, and foraging abilities that help you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices That Shape the Valley</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Endings</strong><br>Will you champion the frail hopes of humankind\u2014fortifying the village against decay\u2014or embrace the forest\u2019s fierce will, letting its wild magic reclaim the land? Your affinity for Nature or Humanity determines both your powers and the fate of Wither.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Characters &amp; Hidden Truths</strong><br>Forge uneasy bonds with villagers like Osric, the fallen woodcutter; and sisters Ragna and Lyra, whose reckless courage may doom or save them all. Piece together the secret behind your gift\u2014and discover the true cost of the sacrifice needed to heal a world on the edge of ruin.</p>",
    "short_description": "You are a nameless, voiceless girl, with no memory, who appears in a dying hamlet, just in time to try and save the last few inhabitants - if you choose. Grow, cook, brew, explore, trade and choose between humanity\u2019s fragile hope or nature\u2019s fierce wrath in this low-fantasy, first-person adventure.",
